Does anyone happen to know where patches are kept for the HSZ70 HSOF 
firmware? We're currently running firmware V77Z but are pretty sure we need 
to either upgrade (I *think* 7.7 is the latest/greatest but could easily be 
wrong) or get to patch level 4. Trying to dig through the HP site to find 
this has been fruitless thus far.

The reason we need to get patched is because we upgraded from Tru64 Unix V4 
to V5 and we're not seeing all of the devices (units) because they're 
uniquely identified by bus/target/lun and in V5 they need to be uniquely 
identified by wwid. We've definitely ascertained that this is NOT 
happening, and therefore Tru64 Unix V5 is not able to uniquely identify the 
devices.

