Hi Jerry,

I've seen this happen when prpasswdd is hung up and won't update the C2
database o login. The login process hangs indefinately waiting for it to
return, resulting in the behaviour you are seeing.

If prpasswdd isn't running, start it using the /sbin/rc3.d script. If it
is running, stop and start it using that same script.

Hope this helps,

Danielle.

