The original message / quastion was  


Hi Managers,

On a 4.0G server could user the ' uerf -R -o full ' command.
When I use it on a 5.1 system we got a core-dump.

Is uerf obsolete ? Are there other usefull tools to look into the errorfile
?

++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
Solution was 

Use dia with the same flags as uerf. 
Example : dia -R -o full | more 

Or use CA (Compaq Analyze)


++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

Thanks again.
Regards, Gert Maaskant
 


